sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User / Dashboard
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant MutWH as Mutating Webhook<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant ValWH as Validating Webhook<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant NbCtrl as notebook-controller<br/>ServiceAccount token
    participant ODHCtrl as odh-notebook-controller<br/>ServiceAccount token
    participant Gateway as Platform Gateway<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant KubeRBAC as kube-rbac-proxy<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Jupyter as Notebook Container<br/>8888/TCP HTTP
    participant CullingR as CullingReconciler

    Note over User,Jupyter: Flow 1: Notebook Creation
    User->>K8sAPI: POST Notebook CR<br/>Auth: User token (RBAC)
    K8sAPI->>MutWH: /mutate-notebook-v1<br/>Kubernetes admission
    MutWH-->>K8sAPI: Inject kube-rbac-proxy sidecar<br/>+ TLS volumes + ImageStream resolution
    K8sAPI->>ValWH: /validate-notebook-v1<br/>Kubernetes admission
    ValWH-->>K8sAPI: Validate PodSpec security<br/>+ MLflow annotation rules
    K8sAPI-->>NbCtrl: Watch event: Notebook created
    NbCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create StatefulSet + Service<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
    K8sAPI-->>ODHCtrl: Watch event: Notebook created
    ODHCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create HTTPRoute + NetworkPolicy<br/>+ RoleBinding + ServiceAccount + Secrets<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token

    Note over User,Jupyter: Flow 2: Notebook Access (via Gateway)
    User->>Gateway: GET notebook URL<br/>Auth: Bearer token / OAuth
    Gateway->>KubeRBAC: Forward request<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS
    KubeRBAC->>K8sAPI: TokenReview + SubjectAccessReview<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    K8sAPI-->>KubeRBAC: Auth result
    KubeRBAC->>Jupyter: Forward to notebook<br/>8888/TCP HTTP (localhost)
    Jupyter-->>KubeRBAC: Response
    KubeRBAC-->>Gateway: Response
    Gateway-->>User: Notebook UI

    Note over CullingR,Jupyter: Flow 3: Idle Culling
    CullingR->>Jupyter: Check activity<br/>8888/TCP HTTP
    Jupyter-->>CullingR: Activity status
    alt Notebook is idle
        CullingR->>K8sAPI: Patch Notebook annotation<br/>(stop notebook)<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    end
